in\n\" Required:\ncall dein#add('~/.cache/dein/repos/github.com/Shougo/dein.vim')\n\n\ncall dein#load_toml('~/config/vim/dein/dein.toml')\ncall dein#load_toml('~/config/vim/dein/dein_lazy.toml')\n\n\n\"Required:\ncall dein#end()\ncall dein#call_hook('source')\n\n\" If you want to install not installed plugins on startup.\nif dein#check_install()\n  call dein#install()\nendif\n\ncall map(dein#check_clean(), \"delete(v:val, 'rf')\")\nlet g:dein#auto_recache = 1\n\n\"}}}End dein Scripts-------------------------\n\nexec 'source' expand('~/config/vim/editor.vim')\nexec 'source' expand('~/config/vim/keymap.vim')\nexec 'source' expand('~/config/vim/command.vim')\n\n\n```","mrkdwn_in":["text"],"blocks":null,"footer":"\u003chttps://github.com/hashue/config|hashue/config\u003e","footer_icon":"https://slack.github.com/static/img/favicon-neutral.png"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"d0IK"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d7c1bff8-6f36-4e59-9ffa-27c12175ca2c","type":"message","user":"U01AQ5BFNLX","text":"わかるけど、init.vimのなにが遅いかわからないのもつらい","ts":"1631318207.218400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"UC3a"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c18d3c77-462b-431e-89ae-fad9ee1b119e","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"python3使わないから、これ無効にしないな\n```200.648  118.521  117.948: sourcing /usr/local/share/nvim/runtime/autoload/provider/python3.vim```","ts":"1631318204.218200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"2LWx"}]},{"client_msg_id":"01466e3d-3eb2-4c73-b94e-c3ae3fcf4c12","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"ちょっと遅い感がある\n半分がinit.vimなのは改善余地がある\n```356.494  000.002: --- NVIM STARTED ---```","ts":"1631318158.217400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"djO"}]},{"client_msg_id":"572c2f17-c94c-44c0-9beb-08d34c85a69